                            <p>
                                The Institute for African Languages and Culture is offering the following courses in selected major African languages of West Africa to high school students. Current language offerings are: Yoruba (Nigeria), and Twi/Akan (Ghana). The classes are taught by experienced linguists who are native speakers of these languages. For more information, please contact the institute.
                            </p>


